Make it from scratch!

08:27.520 --> 08:28.980
Wh-What?!{Fibi: Should it be "What?"}

08:30.360 --> 08:35.700
Okay. Since you know what's going on,
you can start searching around the river.{Fibi: Sounds like "Bullshit" to me ^_^}

08:36.490 --> 08:37.700
Yes!

08:40.990 --> 08:42.580
Look, Kotone-chan!

08:43.790 --> 08:46.250
All according to plan.{Orig: Just as according to keikaku. }

08:46.790 --> 08:51.670
Chitose-san, practice is going to start... soon...

08:56.430 --> 08:58.890
<b>Akiyama Chitose (15)</b>

08:56.430 --> 08:58.890
<b>Middle School 3rd Year, Soft Tennis Club President</b>

09:06.850 --> 09:13.650
<b></b>S
O
F
T

 T
E
N
N
I
S

 T
E
A
M<b></b>

09:06.850 --> 09:13.650
<b>m 0 0 l 363 0 l 363 97 l 0 97</b>

09:07.190 --> 09:10.730
Chitose-san, what were you
doing in a place like that? {Chitose-san, what are doing in a place like that}

09:11.530 --> 09:17.070
About that... the river looked so inviting. {About that.. well the river looks rather inviting}

09:17.070 --> 09:21.370
By chance I met a giant salamander while taking a dip.

09:21.370 --> 09:24.040
Then I just fooled around with it for a bit.

09:25.790 --> 09:28.830
What's with that reaction?

09:28.830 --> 09:30.630
Nothing.

09:30.630 --> 09:33.760
Um, we just thought that, based
on your personality, you were...

09:33.760 --> 09:35.380
Of course not!

09:35.380 --> 09:40.800
I'd never think about eating protected animals.

09:45.730 --> 09:49.350
But you really did come to morning practice.

09:49.350 --> 09:51.900
Yes! And we ran here, seriously!

09:51.900 --> 09:54.110
With a bit of a bus trip in the middle.

09:54.740 --> 09:57.820
But, I really ran properly after getting off!

09:57.820 --> 09:59.910
It's the last tournament for Chitose-san,

09:59.910 --> 10:02.410
so I want to work hard as well!

10:02.910 --> 10:06.120
At least getting into the Top Sixteen!

10:06.120 --> 10:07.040
Asuna.

10:09.170 --> 10:12.750
What's with getting into the Top Sixteen?

10:12.750 --> 10:15.550
If you want a goal - Wimbledon!

10:15.550 --> 10:16.920
<b><b>Eh!?</b></b>

10:15.760 --> 10:16.420
Eh?

10:17.220 --> 10:19.640
Um... about Wimbledon...

10:19.640 --> 10:23.430
What? Of course the goal has
to be as big as possible!

10:23.430 --> 10:25.060
That's not what I mean.

10:25.060 --> 10:26.180
That's right.

10:27.390 --> 10:31.560
The goal has to be as big as possible. {No matter what, a goal has to be as high as it can}

10:31.560 --> 10:35.530
So, I'll be the champion of the tournament!

10:37.400 --> 10:41.070
<i>Chitose-san, before talking about the championship,</i>

10:41.070 --> 10:43.530
<i>we have to first win the preliminaries.</i>

10:43.530 --> 10:45.830
Hm? What is it?

10:45.830 --> 10:47.450
N-Nothing!

10:47.450 --> 10:49.620
Right, nothing!

10:49.620 --> 10:50.960
Ah, it's Kurusu-chan.

10:52.000 --> 10:55.000
Hey Kurusu, you're late!

10:55.000 --> 10:57.840
You made your seniors wait, what were you-

10:56.460 --> 10:58.670
<b>Fuyukawa Kurusu (13)</b>

10:56.460 --> 10:58.670
<b>Middle School 1st Year</b>

10:56.460 --> 10:58.670
<b>Soft Tennis Club Member</b>

11:01.300 --> 11:03.180
I can't even be angry anymore.

11:05.430 --> 11:12.350
<b>Where the hell 
did she get this...</b>

11:05.850 --> 11:08.730
So, why were you late?

11:08.730 --> 11:11.400
Ah, you probably slept in.

11:11.400 --> 11:12.350
Self practice.

11:12.350 --> 11:13.190
What?

11:13.690 --> 11:20.240
I jogged 20 km, did 500 swings, 100 pushups, as well as abs and back exercises.

11:20.240 --> 11:24.160
Did four sets of z-patterned sprints
and sprinting in all directions.

11:24.160 --> 11:27.330
When I came to, it was already this late.

11:29.450 --> 11:32.670
But being late is being late.
I apologize sincerely.

11:32.670 --> 11:37.960
I-If that's the case, you're forgiven this time.

11:39.050 --> 11:41.470
<i>I don't know what to say.</i>

11:42.090 --> 11:44.510
A-All right! {A-All right !}

11:45.430 --> 11:48.850
E-Everyone's here! Let's have a match!

11:55.480 --> 11:57.650
I won't lose!

11:59.650 --> 12:02.530
So, I'll start my service!

12:02.530 --> 12:04.110
Here I come!

12:04.110 --> 12:05.280
Serve.

12:05.280 --> 12:08.740
Damn, homeroom's starting soon.

12:08.740 --> 12:10.870
But we're still playing with each other.

12:10.870 --> 12:12.750
We'll talk about it later!

12:13.330 --> 12:15.750
Oh shit, I forgot the staff meeting.

12:16.210 --> 12:18.420
Hurry up, hurry up! {Extra: this is bad, we are going to get it ! Hey move it !}

12:19.460 --> 12:21.590
This is bad, we're gonna get done in!

12:21.590 --> 12:22.720
Hey, move it!

12:27.760 --> 12:31.730
First of all, let's review 
the previous lesson.

12:33.020 --> 12:35.600
<i>We came so early for once.</i>

12:35.600 --> 12:40.070
We couldn't even hit the ball one time.

12:46.990 --> 12:48.490
We didn't get to play this morning,

12:48.490 --> 12:52.120
so we have to do even more special
training to bring out our true potential!

12:57.630 --> 12:59.960
Ouch.

13:04.260 --> 13:06.050
Hey, Asuna!

13:07.090 --> 13:09.640
How sneaky to practice by yourself!

13:09.640 --> 13:11.640
Count me in.

13:12.640 --> 13:15.520
What's going on? You used so many balls.

13:15.520 --> 13:18.440
Are you practicing serves?
Or were you playing against the wall?

13:19.440 --> 13:22.610
Nothing like that. {Well nothing of the sort}

13:23.740 --> 13:26.280
So that's what happened. {So, that is what it is }

13:26.280 --> 13:29.830
You're normally so laid back.

