14:40.560 --> 14:43.360
I want to make stew for dinner, {[what the fuck is this i don't even-]}{I want to make stew}

14:43.860 --> 14:47.030
milk ice-cream, milk noodles,

14:47.030 --> 14:50.780
cheesecake, and thousand-layer cake!

